<p>Slam your saws into your target, dealing 100% weapon damage + <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 14%, 19%, 23%, 26%</acronym> per physical, magical, or mental effect on them (up to 7 effects).</p><p>Sustains are not effects.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">The Metal Punisher!</span></span></p>